Privat24 for business is a mobile application for legal entities and entrepreneurs.

Round-the-clock access to accounts and payments in real-time. All financial transactions in your smartphone. 
To log in to the app, you just need to be a PrivatBank client. 

With the app, you can:
    • monitor all operations on the account;
    • make any payment in the national currency;
    • generate an extract;
    • buy or sell currency;
    • pay on received electronic invoices;
    • quickly create a qualified SmartID electronic signature and much more.

The app has introduced anti-fraud measures. We use data on your device and its location to prevent possible fraudulent activity when creating a SmartID signature.

Right now, we are working on expanding the program's functionality. Rate our new interface! 
Thank you for your feedback on this page ;)

You can always send your suggestions and comments to p24b_mobile@privatbank.ua.
